Tanga nehutsanana hwemaoko uye zvizivise iwe pachako.

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:13.741
Simbisa kuti mwana ndiani, tsanangura kuongorora uye kuwana mvumo yekuzviita.

4
00:00:13.741 --> 00:00:20.612
Mwana anofanira kubatwa akachengeteka uye zvakanaka pamakumbo kana pafudzi.

5
00:00:20.612 --> 00:00:23.618
Zvakakosha kuti vanzwe vakachengeteka.

6
00:00:23.618 --> 00:00:28.341
Tanga nekubvunza kana paine zvirikunetsa nezve general development,

7
00:00:28.341 --> 00:00:33.065
kuona kana kuonekwa kwemaziso, wobva waona zvimwe.

8
00:00:33.065 --> 00:00:36.500
Wana pfungwa yemwana mukuru uye

9
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.992
kukura kwekuona nekutarisa mafambiro avanoita, toni yavo nemamiriro uye

10
00:00:39.992 --> 00:00:40.740
zvakanaka sei

11
00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.684
inogona kugadzirisa pachiso chako nemaziso.

12
00:00:42.684 --> 00:00:45.460
Fambisa musoro wako kubva kune rumwe rutivi kuenda kune rumwe rutivi, wedzera chinhambwe chako

13
00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:46.815
uye nyemwerera wakanyarara.

14
00:00:46.815 --> 00:00:51.220
Cherechedza kuti kugadzirisa kwakagadzikana sei, kana vakapindura kunyarara kwako

15
00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:53.888
kunyemwerera uye chinhambwe chavanorasikirwa nacho kugadzirisa.

16
00:00:53.888 --> 00:00:56.260
Panguva imwe chete tarisa chero zviratidzo

17
00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:59.733
yemaziso anodedera, tsinzi, ziso dzvuku kana chena pupil.

18
00:00:59.733 --> 00:01:02.820
Wobva wagadzirira arc mwenje nekusarudza iyo

19
00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:04.632
chiedza chinopenya zvikuru nekudzvanya katatu.

20
00:01:04.632 --> 00:01:07.220
Ita shuwa kuti lens rack iri kumusoro uko

