25
00:01:14.793 --> 00:01:18.900
Isa buri pedyo neziso rako uye pakureba kweruoko ona

26
00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:22.225
iyo fungal reflex mumaziso maviri panguva imwe chete.

27
00:01:22.225 --> 00:01:24.220
