33
00:01:39.822 --> 00:01:41.460
In a normal examination imomo

34
00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:45.199
haifanirwe kuve nemusiyano wakazara mukupenya uye ruvara pakati pemaziso maviri

35
00:01:45.199 --> 00:01:46.000
