36
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.436
zviratidziro zvichionekwa nechepakati.

37
00:01:47.436 --> 00:01:52.700
Iyi inguva dzose fundal reflex test yemwana muchena.

38
00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:56.028
Muvana vasiri vachena ruvara rwefundal reflex rwakasiyana.

39
