44
00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:17.200
Zvakawanikwa zvisina kujairika ndezvekuti paine kuramba kuchienderera kweruvara kana kupenya musiyano pakati

45
00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:23.460
iwo maziso maviri, a displaced corneal reflection, chigamba chakasviba chiripo mukati me reflex yeimwe

46
00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:28.220
kana maziso ose, kana kusavapo zvachose reflex.

47
00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:33.380
Kupfupisa, ongororo yakajairika ndipo pasisina musiyano wakazara mukupenya

48
00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:38.380
uye ruvara pakati pemaziso maviri, nepakati corneal reflections.

49
00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:42.580
Abnormal fungal reflex ndipo pane musiyano mukupenya uye ruvara

50
00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:48.060
pakati pemaziso maviri, corneal reflection yakabviswa, chigamba chakasviba chiripo mukati me

51
00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:54.017
reflex yeziso rimwe chete kana maviri, kana kusavapo zvachose.

52
00:02:54.017 --> 00:02:55.100
An abnormal

53
00:02:55.100 --> 00:03:01.660
fundal reflex test inogona kuratidza kuvepo kwecataract, retublastoma, corneal

54
00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:07.900
vanga, kutswinya, chikanganiso chekuona, kana chimiro chisina kumira zvakanaka senge coloboa.

55
00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:11.536
Izvi zvese zvinoda kumwe kuongororwa nenyanzvi.

56
00:03:11.536 --> 00:03:12.900
Mushure mekuongorora

57
00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:17.020
dzokorora hutsanana hwemaoko, tenda mubereki kana kutarisira uye kunyora uye tsanangura yako

58
