Bvumiranai hurongwa hwakajeka hwekumwe kuongorora kana zvichidiwa.

60
00:03:20.644 --> 00:03:23.180
Ndokumbira utarise imwe yedu

61
00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:25.580
Mayunivhesiti uye Andrews Arc Chiedza chirongwa mavhidhiyo.
